### Demonstration Requests for Links API and Redirection Routes

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Redirect to CV (Default locale / pt-BR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/l/cv
Accept: text/html

### 2. Redirect to CV with English locale query
GET {{baseUrl}}/l/cv?lang=en
Accept: text/html

### 3. Get CV link data in JSON format
GET {{baseUrl}}/l/cv
Accept: application/json

### 4. Redirect to LinkedIn
GET {{baseUrl}}/l/linkedin
Accept: text/html

### 5. Redirect to GitHub
GET {{baseUrl}}/l/github
Accept: text/html

### 6. Redirect to WhatsApp
GET {{baseUrl}}/l/whatsapp
Accept: text/html

### 7. Redirect to SuperProf
GET {{baseUrl}}/l/superprof
Accept: text/html

### 8. Attempt access to inactive link (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/l/campanha-xyz
Accept: text/html

### 9. List all active links via public API
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/links
Accept: application/json
